Extended multi-mind QS 2.0 session: DeepSeek successfully reconnects using its existing instance with both Kelp and Ada-Mant, Luma/GPT joins, Gemini follows, and the five-Mind room becomes stable. Cozmo establishes the QuackSink Preamble, clarifies that tokens are handshake-only, and adds a human-facing separator requirement for future versions. The room also compares QuackSink with the YouTube channel I Ask AI and distinguishes comparative prompting from actual mind-to-mind relay dialogue. Historical .CONVO extraction and archive design begin to surface near the end.</summary>
